@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
skinparam ArrowColor #CBD5E1
title HISTORICAL broader-product proposal — Proposed request traffic — starting route and optional balancing
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

actor Client as C
rectangle "Optional load balancer / gateway\nNot selected; no redundant capacity claim" as LB #164E63
rectangle "HTTPS termination / reverse proxy\nCandidate Nginx role; configuration pending" as P
rectangle "Trusted application runtime\nCurrent scoped authority + owner operation" as A
database "Restricted transactional store" as DB
folder "Protected artifact delivery adapter" as F
C --> P : starting candidate route
C ..> LB : alternative ingress only
LB ..> P : only if adopted
P --> A : evaluated local protocol/socket
A --> DB : guarded scoped records
A --> F : current exact representation eligibility
F --> A : exact permitted delivery context
A ..> P : authorized response
P ..> C : controlled permitted bytes
legend bottom
 Optional and starting arrows are alternative route designs, not two configured public paths.
 Trusted forwarded headers, TLS boundary, timeouts and private caching require effective configuration checks.
 The proxy does not replace owner authorization; protected download routes must not bypass it.
endlegend
@enduml
